    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Iron Revenge 3D</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short, intense retro first-person shooter about violence, orders, and consequence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Iron Revenge 3D is a tightly focused singleplayer FPS with 30 short missions set in tight, maze-like corridors and brutalist interiors. The gameplay is fast and minimal - no upgrades, no crafting, no filler. Just you, a weapon, and the next objective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gunfights are quick and punishing. Ammo is limited. Every shot has weight. Between missions, short bursts of dialogue tell a grounded story about loyalty, betrayal, and the cost of following orders. You can skip the dialogue entirely - or pay attention and see what\u2019s really going on beneath the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No meta-progression. No collectibles. No filler.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just a sharp, two-hour experience for players who miss when shooters respected their time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Iron Revenge 3D is a fictional work inspired by real-world conflicts. It does not endorse any group or ideology.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Iron Revenge 3D</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short, intense retro first-person shooter about violence, orders, and consequence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Iron Revenge 3D is a tightly focused singleplayer FPS with 30 short missions set in tight, maze-like corridors and brutalist interiors. The gameplay is fast and minimal - no upgrades, no crafting, no filler. Just you, a weapon, and the next objective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gunfights are quick and punishing. Ammo is limited. Every shot has weight. Between missions, short bursts of dialogue tell a grounded story about loyalty, betrayal, and the cost of following orders. You can skip the dialogue entirely - or pay attention and see what\u2019s really going on beneath the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No meta-progression. No collectibles. No filler.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just a sharp, two-hour experience for players who miss when shooters respected their time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Iron Revenge 3D is a fictional work inspired by real-world conflicts. It does not endorse any group or ideology.</i></p>",
    "short_description": "A fast, focused retro FPS. Fight through 30 missions with tight gunplay, no filler, and a grim story you can choose to follow or ignore. No upgrades. No distractions. Just a weapon, a target, and the consequences that follow.",
